/|| This is a baseline single-line bookshelf comment
int alpha = 10;

/||
    This tests a multi-line bookshelf comment layout.
    If the line-counter engine functions correctly,
    the compiler error thrown on the next line will point
    precisely to line 9.
int beta = "This string intentional type error forces line check verification";

/||
    /|| inside a bookshelf comment is just text, not nested
        deeper indentation is still part of the comment
    the comment continues until indentation returns
int gamma = 42;

/|| Chained single-line bookshelf comments
/|| Next bookshelf comment at the same indent works too
int delta = 100;

/|| Comment that ends at EOF without explicit closer
    This trailing text is part of the comment
